    "body": "@domenic,\n\nI didn't know there are tools which can take advantage of semantics. Do you mean screen readers? In my humble opinion, semantics isn't just something we pursue only when there are tools which can take advantage of it. Personally, I regard semantics as the soul of a HTML document. A HTML document without semantics is like a person with only an empty shell. I think I'm obligate to infuse semantics into HTML documents and make them alive.\n",
