    "updated_at": "2016-11-20T02:23:19Z",
    "body": "So there's no benefit for users?\n\nI would instead then suggest using your own custom element if you feel that there are important semantics to be conveyed here besides div, since you are only conveying them to yourself. Let's close this since the spec already provided a grouping element and if you don't find it sufficient it already allows custom elements for such purposes.\n",
