    "created_at": "2016-11-20T02:40:20Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-20T02:40:20Z",
    "body": "@domenic,\n\nNot sure if you are referring to [a working draft](https://www.w3.org/TR/custom-elements/), but that's just a working draft and not a formal spec. Besides, that requires JavaScript and users with JavaScript disabled will not see expected results. Even users with JavaScript enabled will see [FOUC](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flash_of_unstyled_content).\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
