    "created_at": "2016-11-20T22:08:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-20T22:08:37Z",
    "body": "To clarify a few things here...\n- https://html5.validator.nu/ is a Web service for https://github.com/validator/validator/ hosted by @hsivonen \n- https://checker.html5.org/ is a Web service for https://github.com/validator/validator/ hosted by @sideshowbarker.\n- Both of the above track the WHATWG HTML spec, but the latter is more up-to-date currently.\n- `div` in `dl` changed in the spec recently, see https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/1937. (`g` in `dl` would have problems with parsing, as discussed in that issue.)\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
